# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"A quantum-classical workflow runs as one managed workflow job. Its classical stages run on your compute profile, and the primitive jobs that it sends to an IBM Quantum&reg; QPU run on your instance and count against your usage. From that one job, you can report each stage, find the QPU jobs, and cancel them. To start a job and check its status and logs, see [Run a managed workflow](/guides/run-managed-workflow).\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Um workflow quântico-clássico é executado como um único job de workflow gerenciado. Suas etapas clássicas são executadas no seu perfil de computação, e os jobs de primitiva que ele envia a uma QPU da IBM Quantum&reg; são executados na sua instância e contam para o seu uso. A partir desse único job, você pode relatar cada etapa, encontrar os jobs de QPU e cancelá-los. Para iniciar um job e verificar seu status e logs, consulte [Execute um workflow gerenciado](/guides/run-managed-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin, [deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow).\n"
msgstr "Antes de começar, [implante seu primeiro workflow gerenciado](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Runtime service {#create-the-runtime-service}"
msgstr "Crie o serviço Runtime {#create-the-runtime-service}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Runtime service in your workflow code with `get_runtime_service()`, and use it in the same way that you use `QiskitRuntimeService` locally. The following workflow runs a Bell circuit with the Sampler primitive, reports each stage with `update_status()`, and returns the counts:\n"
msgstr "Crie o serviço Runtime no código do seu workflow com `get_runtime_service()` e use-o da mesma forma que você usa `QiskitRuntimeService` localmente. O workflow a seguir executa um circuito de Bell com a primitiva Sampler, relata cada etapa com `update_status()` e retorna as contagens:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_runtime_service()` returns a `QiskitRuntimeService` that is set up for your managed workflow job, and it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "`get_runtime_service()` retorna um `QiskitRuntimeService` configurado para o seu job de workflow gerenciado e oferece o seguinte:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Credentials.** The Runtime service uses the API key, instance, and channel that you used to call `run()`, so the workflow code needs no credentials.\n"
msgstr "**Credenciais.** O serviço Runtime usa a chave de API, a instância e o canal que você usou para chamar `run()`, então o código do workflow não precisa de credenciais.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tracking.** A workflow records every primitive job that runs through this Runtime service under the managed workflow job, including Sampler, Estimator, and Executor jobs, and jobs in a session or batch. You can list them with `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"
msgstr "**Rastreamento.** Um workflow registra todo job de primitiva executado por meio deste serviço Runtime sob o job de workflow gerenciado, incluindo jobs de Sampler, Estimator e Executor, e jobs em uma sessão ou em lote. Você pode listá-los com `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cancellation.** When you call `job.cancel()`, the managed workflow also cancels the workflow's sessions, batches, and primitive jobs that are still running.\n"
msgstr "**Cancelamento.** Quando você chama `job.cancel()`, o workflow gerenciado também cancela as sessões, os lotes e os jobs de primitiva do workflow que ainda estão em execução.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow does not track or cancel the jobs of a service that you create with `QiskitRuntimeService()`, although the jobs still run. If the workflow must use another service, cancel its jobs in a [`SIGTERM` handler](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#clean-up-when-a-job-is-canceled).\n"
msgstr "Um workflow gerenciado não rastreia nem cancela os jobs de um serviço que você cria com `QiskitRuntimeService()`, embora os jobs ainda sejam executados. Se o workflow precisar usar outro serviço, cancele seus jobs em um [handler de `SIGTERM`](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#clean-up-when-a-job-is-canceled).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
